{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Time Slowdown | One-Hit Kill\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use abilities to temporarily control time flow, parry at the perfect moment, and instantly eliminate enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/dc00b28cc8405740dea3aba7e5fbbfe6.poster.avif?t=1766327375\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/dc00b28cc8405740dea3aba7e5fbbfe6.webm?t=1766327375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/dc00b28cc8405740dea3aba7e5fbbfe6.mp4?t=1766327375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Reverse Time and Space | Dual Characters\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely switch between temporal identities and flexibly utilize different character skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/8f0e7a1b93274bb7b10a8c0fbe70cd6c.poster.avif?t=1766327375\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/8f0e7a1b93274bb7b10a8c0fbe70cd6c.webm?t=1766327375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/8f0e7a1b93274bb7b10a8c0fbe70cd6c.mp4?t=1766327375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Unique Mechanisms | Interactive Puzzles\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scenes across different timelines feature distinct special mechanisms\u2014outsmarting enemies is more engaging than brute-force slashing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/bb4ea718faace28462e095b92102f824.poster.avif?t=1766327375\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/bb4ea718faace28462e095b92102f824.webm?t=1766327375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/bb4ea718faace28462e095b92102f824.mp4?t=1766327375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Fragmented Narrative | Multiple Endings\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter NPCs from various time periods; your choices will turn them into allies or foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/50a42b6d91a9e1df521e20302c4c14b4.poster.avif?t=1766327375\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/50a42b6d91a9e1df521e20302c4c14b4.webm?t=1766327375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/50a42b6d91a9e1df521e20302c4c14b4.mp4?t=1766327375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the journey begins, the wheel of fate starts to turn.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3197180?t=1766327375","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/bbb5aab0919192212d4b2b4292f4015c627c47b2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766327375","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse